  "decision": "NO_CHANGE",
  "workflow_yaml": null,
  "rationale": "The workflow already applies the dependency-download caching optimization (P-LIT-GHA-CACHE) through ruby/setup-ruby@v1 with bundler-cache: true, which caches Bundler gems keyed on the lockfile while keeping installation and all required tests. The matrix intentionally uses fail-fast: false so every OS/Ruby combination result is preserved; enabling fail-fast (P-LIT-FAIL-FAST) would cancel remaining matrix cells and reduce the intended build/test coverage, which must be preserved. The Test step already carries an explicit timeout-minutes: 10, and the single available CI run is insufficient representative history to derive a new history-based or custom timeout (P-LIT-HISTORY-TIMEOUT/P-LIT-CUSTOM-TIMEOUT). No other evidence-supported optimization applies without weakening coverage, adding unrelated changes, or lacking applicable prerequisites.",
  "evidence_ids": ["P-LIT-GHA-CACHE", "P-LIT-FAIL-FAST"]
}
